title: "MumfordShah2D: Edge-preserving image restoration via the Mumford-Shah model"
version: 0.5.1
date-released: 2026-05-08
abstract: "Algorithms for edge-preserving image restoration based on the Mumford-Shah model. Original MATLAB / Java reference implementation by Hohm, Storath, and Weinmann; a Python / Rust port (package `mumfordshah2d`) is being added to the same repository."
